Use?  Yes, *you* do.  Make, is another story.  Google is your friend.  

LN03 is not one of the best laser printers ever made.  It *works*, and 
it can do a lot, especially if you like SIXELs, but the toner is loose, 
not in a self-contained cartridge.  You can make quite the mess if 
you're not careful.  I always washed my hands after refilling the toner 
bin, regardless.  There's always some that gets out.

The toner collection bottle is not emptied when it's full.  The bottle 
is sealed and replaced with an empty.  Read the operating procedures and 
you'll see how to use the device.

