I found some paper docs here identifying the BA35X-MH
as "16-bit I/O Module (FAST 10 Only)"
The differential module is BA35X-DA.

So your SCSi module is most likely not HVD, but single
ended SCSI. Maybe it's a SCSI issue when the SCSI
controller sees some UltraSCSI disks, but the I/O
module doesn't do UltraSCSI speed.

Dennis

